[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13320.71, "timestamp": "03:42:00", "text": "我只知道Willow不会进去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13322.229, "timestamp": "03:42:02", "text": "嗯，不知何故被放进了锅里。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13324.229, "timestamp": "03:42:04", "text": "Willow，我感觉有人逃跑了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13326.15, "timestamp": "03:42:06", "text": "从身体中。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13330.229, "timestamp": "03:42:10", "text": "等等，我眼前一黑。我甚至都做不到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13333.349, "timestamp": "03:42:13", "text": "我不知道是不是真的不确定。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13335.11, "timestamp": "03:42:15", "text": "忘记了那些颜色。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13338.95, "timestamp": "03:42:18", "text": "水。我差点就进去了。不，我没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13342.95, "timestamp": "03:42:22", "text": "甚至来。我的意思是，你当时就是你当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13344.55, "timestamp": "03:42:24", "text": "远离身体，对吧？我跳过了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13347.99, "timestamp": "03:42:27", "text": "我不知道。我可以跳过那一步。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13349.83, "timestamp": "03:42:29", "text": "他独自一人。我只看到他一个人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13351.91, "timestamp": "03:42:31", "text": "离开公交车。不，我见过他。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13353.83, "timestamp": "03:42:33", "text": "和某人。我看到他和别人在一起。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13356.15, "timestamp": "03:42:36", "text": "等等，它到底在哪儿？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13367.349, "timestamp": "03:42:47", "text": "我猜是堆积在管道上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13371.349, "timestamp": "03:42:51", "text": "好吧，除了糟糕透了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13373.51, "timestamp": "03:42:53", "text": "他径直从他身边走过，然后被杀了。"}]